# Navigation

- Start from `.cursor/MAP.md` (or root `AGENTS.md` → MAP).
- Prefer `@` specific paths over whole-repo search.
- Large Excel / HTML / prompt dumps: read README or targeted sections only.
- Sample Excel lives under `server/testdata/`; implementation lives under `server/flows/` and `frontend/`.
- Formal deploy contract: `server/langgraph.json`. Local development: `server/langgraph.dev.json`. Both currently register `agent` and three business graphs; verify the files before changing the deployment contract.
